_struct.entry_id SMR-7d3644ceffe8893c645fce5a54d4d1e8_1
_struct.pdbx_model_details
;This model was generated unsupervised by the SWISS-MODEL homology-modelling pipeline for the SWISS-MODEL Repository, a database of annotated 3D protein structure models. The modelled homo-trimer covers following UniProtKB entries:

  - A6K7Z6/ A6K7Z6_RAT, STEAP family member 3
  - Q5RKL5/ STEA3_RAT, Metalloreductase STEAP3

Estimated model accuracy of this model is 0.749, calculated by SWISS-MODEL as Global Model Quality Estimate (GMQE).
;
_struct.pdbx_structure_determination_methodology computational
_struct.title 'Model for UniProtKB entries A6K7Z6, Q5RKL5'
